        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = \"image\")": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = \"color\")": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            ".content-head": {
              "max-width": "800px"
            },
            ".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "text-align": "justify",
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#fa0000",
              "text-align": "justify"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title DIV": {
              "text-align": "center"
            }
          },
          "_name": "header12",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"header12\" group=\"Headers\" mbr-class=\"{\n  'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n  'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Image Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"showImage\">\n\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Image\" name=\"showImage\" checked>\n\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#000000\" selected>\n    </fieldset>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"text-center\" mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row mb-4 justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"showImage\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{imageWidth}}\">\n        <a href=\"index.html\"><img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/bua20black-1536x1024.webp\" alt></a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"col-md-12 content-head\">\n        <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><div><b>Black Unicorn Audio</b></div><div><br></div></h2>\n        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"><b>&nbsp;Software Licence Agreement and Limitation of Liability   <br></b><br><br><br><b>1. Scope<br></b><br>These terms apply to software, audio plug-ins, instruments, effects, beta releases, demonstration versions, updates and associated materials distributed by Black Unicorn Audio and all its associated brands, including Friends Lovers &amp; Family, Quietman, etc.<br><br><b>2. Software licence</b><br><b><br></b>Software is licensed, not sold. Users are granted a limited, non-exclusive licence to install and use the software for personal and commercial music production, subject to these terms and any applicable product-specific licence conditions.<br>Unauthorised redistribution, resale or repackaging of the software is prohibited, except where expressly permitted by the licensor or applicable law.<br><br><b>3. Software supplied as is<br></b><br>To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, all software is supplied “AS IS” and “AS AVAILABLE”, without express or implied warranties, including warranties of fitness for a particular purpose, satisfactory quality, uninterrupted operation or compatibility with particular hardware or software configurations.<br><br><b>4. Responsible use and audio safety<br></b><br>The user acknowledges that creative audio processing may produce unexpected signal levels, frequencies, feedback, transients and other potentially hazardous audio characteristics.<br><br>Users are responsible for appropriate monitoring levels, gain staging, amplification settings and the safe operation of their audio equipment.<br><br><b>Any Ear &amp; Gear Protection functionality or other signal-management features are supplementary tools and do not constitute certified hearing protection or equipment safety systems.</b><br><br><b>DOWNLOAD IT HERE<br></b><br>5. Limitation of liability<br><br>To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, Black Unicorn Audio, its associated legal entities, brands, owners, directors, individual developers, employees, contractors and contributors shall not be liable for indirect, incidental, special or consequential losses arising from the use or inability to use the software.<br><br>This includes, where legally permissible, loss of data, loss of income, interruption of business, damage to equipment and losses resulting from incompatible configurations, unauthorised modifications or misuse.<br><br><b>6. Indemnification<br></b><br>To the extent permitted by applicable law, users agree to indemnify and hold harmless the licensor, its owners, directors, developers and representatives against third-party claims and reasonable associated costs arising from the user's unlawful use, unauthorised redistribution or material breach of this agreement.<br><br>This provision does not require users to indemnify any party against liability that cannot lawfully be excluded or transferred.<br><br><b>7. Beta and experimental software<br></b><br>Beta and experimental releases are supplied for evaluation and testing. They may contain defects, incomplete functionality or unexpected behaviour.<br>Users should maintain independent backups and should not rely on experimental software in safety-critical environments or situations where software failure could cause injury or significant loss.<br><br><b>8. Statutory rights<br></b><br>Nothing in this agreement excludes or limits liability for death or personal injury, fraud, gross negligence, defective products or any other matter to the extent that such liability cannot lawfully be excluded or limited.<br><br>Nothing in this agreement affects mandatory consumer protection rights.<br><br><b>9. Governing law</b><br><b><br></b>This agreement is governed by the laws of Portugal, without prejudice to mandatory consumer protections and jurisdictional rights applicable in the user's country of residence.<br><br><b>10. Acceptance<br></b><br>By expressly accepting these terms, the user agrees to the applicable conditions of the software licence.<br><br>© 2026 Black Unicorn Audio. All rights reserved.<br></p>\n        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n          <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Download now</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vBZrINZnSs",
